meta {
  name: Auth
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Sign-in for Super Admin accounts: its own accounts and tokens, nothing shared
  with the user API. Flow: `Login` returns either a two-factor challenge (run
  `2FA - Verify`) or, for an account that has not enrolled yet, a restricted
  setup token (run `2FA - Enable` then `2FA - Confirm`, then sign in again).
  Tokens last 15 minutes: `Refresh` rotates them. All of it needs
  `SUPER_ADMIN_ENABLED=true`.
}
